(text "Channel A = HIGH_BUF - LOW_BUF; channel B = LOW_BUF - TIA_OUT.\nZ = [RF / (1+j*2*pi*f*RF*CF)] * A/B. CF=100pF on every range; high-range pole=15.9kHz.\nADS9224REVM p26 topology: 22R inside feedback, 100pF || 1k, then 4.32R to ADC.\nREFby2 drives VOCM. REFOUT is decoupled only. Each REFP uses 22uF." (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f5077412-2dc0-5e10-9f44-a721aa7ba39b"))
(text "U8: feedback senses the nodes AFTER 22R, BEFORE 4.32R." (at 20.32 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "aefd479b-1d01-53a9-9ac0-53fff0e532c5"))
